<title>HONG KONG: Trading in First Shanghai suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in First Shanghai suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of finance group First Shanghai Investments Ltd was suspended on Tuesday at the request of the company pending an announcement, the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong said.</p>
<p>The stock closed at HK$0.73 on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
